<title>UK: Two Thurs Brent cargoes kept, third five o'clocked.</title>
<headline>Two Thurs Brent cargoes kept, third five o'clocked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two of three Brent cargoes nominated loading dates was kept on Thursday but a third had not been claimed at the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>BP and Elf kept September 13-15 Brent cargoes.</p>
<p>A third cargo was five o'clocked and in dispute.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
